 34CL c  Isotope discovery (2012Th10): {+31}P(|a,n){+34}Cl (1934Fr01), measured 
 34CL2c  T{-1/2} of the isomer at 146 keV.                                      
 34CL c  {+34}Cl production:                                                    
 34CL c  2016Ka36: {+181}Ta({+11}B,X) and {+209}Bi({+11}B,X) at E({+11}B)=24    
 34CL2c  MeV/nucleon. Measured production cross sections using |g-activation    
 34CL3c  method and offline |g-spectroscopy at the U-400M accelerator and       
 34CL4c  ACCULINA setup of JINR, Dubna.                                         
 34CL c  2013SeZV: {+9}Be({+40}Ar,X) at E({+40}Ar)=35 MeV/nucleon at the COMBAS 
 34CL2c  fragment separator at the Flerov Laboratory of Nuclear Reactions, JINR.
 34CL3c  Measured production cross sections.                                    
 34CL c  2013De37: {+237}Np,{+238}U(p,F) at E(p)=660 MeV at the LNR Phasotron   
 34CL2c  U-400M Cyclotron at JINR, Dubna. Measured E|g, I|g, and production     
 34CL3c  cross sections of fragments.                                           
 34CL c  2012Zh06: {+9}Be,{+181}Ta({+40}Ar,X) at E({+40}Ar)=57 MeV/nucleon at   
 34CL2c  HIRFL. Measured momentum distributions and production cross sections of
 34CL3c  fragments. Observed competition between projectile fragmentation and   
 34CL4c  other mechanisms. Compared with EPAX, abrasion-ablation, and HIPSE     
 34CL5c  models. Studied target dependence of fragment cross sections.          
 34CL c  2011Ti04: {+nat}Ni(p,X) at E(p)=46-2605 MeV using the U-10 ITEP proton 
 34CL2c  synchrotron. Measured production cross sections.                       
 34CL c  2011Ti03: {+nat}Cr(p,X) and {+56}Fe(p,X) at E(p)=42-2605 MeV using the 
 34CL2c  U-10 ITEP proton synchrotron. Measured production cross sections.      
 34CL c  2008Ti05: {+56}Fe(p,X) at E(p)=300-2600 MeV using the U-10 ITEP proton 
 34CL2c  synchrotron. Measured production cross sections.                       
 34CL c  2008Na03: {+nat}S(|a,x){+34m}Cl at E(|a)=14.2-69.5 MeV using the NIRS  
 34CL2c  isochronous cyclotron (AVF930). Measured thick target yields.          
 34CL c  Other {+34}Cl cross-section measurements: 2007Na31, 2004De41, 2003Ya20,
 34CL2c  2002DeZU, 2001Pi10.                                                    
